.DS_Store

# NOTE: dist/ is deliberately NOT ignored — it is committed.
#
# This plugin installs via `dsh plugin add github:…`, and pnpm blocks a git
# dependency's `prepare` script by default: it fails the install and tells the
# user to add an `allowBuilds` key that is pinned to the commit hash, so the
# key would change on every release. Shipping the built host half removes that
# step entirely. Run `npm run build` before committing a change to src/.
